<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom bought back on mkt at NZ$6.96/7.00.</title>
<headline>Telecom bought back on mkt at NZ$6.96/7.00.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Thursday it bought shares on market during Wednesday at prices between NZ$6.96 and $7.00 in the latest round of its buyback programme.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said it bought 118,200 shares. The buyback is set to continue until Telecom advises it has completed the current phase.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64-4 473 4746</p>
</text>
